{% # theme-check-disable ImgWidthAndHeight %}
  <section class="section" aria-labelledby="brands-h">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="sec-head reveal"><span class="eyebrow">Brands we carry</span><h2 id="brands-h">Six houses, one showroom.</h2></div>
      <div class="grid-tiles">
      <a class="tile tile-flip reveal" style="--d:0.0s" href="/pages/brands#david-trubridge"><div class="tile-card"><div class="tile-face tile-front"><div class="lamp" style="--lx:50%;--ly:48%"><img src="{{ 'brand-trubridge.webp' | asset_url }}" alt="David Trubridge pendant lights" loading="lazy"></div></div><div class="tile-face tile-back on-dark"><span class="mono">New Zealand</span><h3 class="tile-back-name">David Trubridge</h3><p>A New Zealand designer known for sculptural kitset pendants in bamboo plywood. The Coral and Ebb ranges can be assembled at home, or by us, priced separately.</p><span class="mono">Carried: Coral 400, Coral 600, Ebb</span><span class="link-arrow">Explore the brand <span class="ico ico-arrow" aria-hidden="true"></span></span></div></div><div class="tile-row stack"><h3 class="tile-name">David Trubridge</h3><span class="mono">New Zealand &middot; sculptural kitset pendants</span></div></a>
      <a class="tile tile-flip reveal" style="--d:0.08s" href="/pages/brands#innolux"><div class="tile-card"><div class="tile-face tile-front"><div class="lamp" style="--lx:38%;--ly:37%"><img src="{{ 'brand-innolux.jpg' | asset_url }}" alt="Innolux lamps" loading="lazy"></div></div><div class="tile-face tile-back on-dark"><span class="mono">Finland</span><h3 class="tile-back-name">Innolux</h3><p>A Finnish lighting house (Innojok Oy) making design lamps alongside bright-light and red-light wellbeing lamps.</p><span class="mono">Carried: Alma, Bulbo, Candeo</span><span class="link-arrow">Explore the brand <span class="ico ico-arrow" aria-hidden="true"></span></span></div></div><div class="tile-row stack"><h3 class="tile-name">Innolux</h3><span class="mono">Finland &middot; design and wellbeing lamps</span></div></a>
      <a class="tile tile-flip reveal" style="--d:0.08s" href="/pages/brands#siru"><div class="tile-card"><div class="tile-face tile-front"><div class="lamp" style="--lx:52%;--ly:18%"><img src="{{ 'brand-siru.jpg' | asset_url }}" alt="Siru Murano glass pendant lights" loading="lazy"></div></div><div class="tile-face tile-back on-dark"><span class="mono">Italy</span><h3 class="tile-back-name">Siru</h3><p>Based on the Venice Lido and founded in 1989 by Rudy Marinotto. Mouth-blown Murano glass is blown inside steel wire frames, so no two pieces are identical.</p><span class="mono">Carried: 306/5 AB, HL093/6-Rock Sv, HL180/8 PN</span><span class="link-arrow">Explore the brand <span class="ico ico-arrow" aria-hidden="true"></span></span></div></div><div class="tile-row stack"><h3 class="tile-name">Siru</h3><span class="mono">Italy &middot; mouth-blown Murano glass</span></div></a>
      <a class="tile tile-flip reveal" style="--d:0.0s" href="/pages/brands#brand-van-egmond"><div class="tile-card"><div class="tile-face tile-front"><div class="lamp" style="--lx:50%;--ly:45%"><img src="{{ 'brand-vanegmond.jpg' | asset_url }}" alt="Brand van Egmond sculptural lighting" loading="lazy"></div></div><div class="tile-face tile-back on-dark"><span class="mono">The Netherlands</span><h3 class="tile-back-name">Brand van Egmond</h3><p>A Dutch lighting studio founded in 1989 by William Brand and Annet van Egmond, based in Naarden and known for sculptural lighting.</p><span class="mono">Carried: Bubbles, Solis, Flower Power, Hollywood Icicles</span><span class="link-arrow">Explore the brand <span class="ico ico-arrow" aria-hidden="true"></span></span></div></div><div class="tile-row stack"><h3 class="tile-name">Brand van Egmond</h3><span class="mono">The Netherlands &middot; sculptural lighting</span></div></a>
      <a class="tile tile-flip reveal" style="--d:0.08s" href="/pages/brands#big-ass-fans"><div class="tile-card"><div class="tile-face tile-front"><div class="lamp" style="--lx:50%;--ly:40%">{%- assign baf = all_products['haiku-l-black'] -%}{% if baf.featured_image %}{{ baf.featured_image | image_url: width: 800 | image_tag: loading: 'lazy', alt: 'Big Ass Fans Haiku L ceiling fan' }}{% else %}<span class="ph">photo to come</span>{% endif %}</div></div><div class="tile-face tile-back on-dark"><span class="mono">United States</span><img src="{{ 'logo-bigassfans.png' | asset_url }}" alt="Big Ass Fans logo" style="max-height:56px;width:auto;align-self:flex-start;background:var(--paper);padding:4px 6px" loading="lazy"><h3 class="tile-back-name">Big Ass Fans</h3><p>Based in Lexington, Kentucky, and founded in 1999. Its Haiku ceiling fans use hand-balanced aerofoils and are whisper-quiet.</p><span class="mono">Carried: Haiku L, Haiku H light kit, Haiku I light kit</span><span class="link-arrow">Explore the brand <span class="ico ico-arrow" aria-hidden="true"></span></span></div></div><div class="tile-row stack"><h3 class="tile-name">Big Ass Fans</h3><span class="mono">United States &middot; Haiku ceiling fans</span></div></a>
      <a class="tile tile-flip reveal" style="--d:0.16s" href="/pages/brands#maju-design"><div class="tile-card"><div class="tile-face tile-front"><div class="lamp" style="--lx:38%;--ly:52%"><img src="{{ 'brand-maju.webp' | asset_url }}" alt="Maju Design table lamps" loading="lazy"></div></div><div class="tile-face tile-back on-dark"><span class="mono">Singapore</span><h3 class="tile-back-name">Maju Design</h3><p>Sustainable table lamps with interchangeable shades and bases, made from plant-based, biodegradable materials.</p><span class="mono">Carried: Maju Wove Nelson, Wove Short, Lily Omni, Unni Short</span><span class="link-arrow">Explore the brand <span class="ico ico-arrow" aria-hidden="true"></span></span></div></div><div class="tile-row stack"><h3 class="tile-name">Maju Design</h3><span class="mono">Singapore &middot; Sustainable table lamps</span></div></a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

